<title>JAPAN: M'shita Elec sees Y80 bln commercial video sales.</title>
<headline>M'shita Elec sees Y80 bln commercial video sales.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it expects sales of commercial-use video system equipment to total some 80 billion yen in fiscal year 1997/98, which started in April, boosted by robust sales of equipment to the media.  </p>
<p>The sales estimate was eight billion yen higher than the previous year's sales of video system equipment, a company official told reporters.</p>
</text>
